### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "HeavyRainIntersection" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 ;
    :hasEvidence :evidence1 .

:weather1 a :RainyCondition .

:risk1 a :RoadConditionRisk ;
    :description "Slippery road surface due to heavy rain, increasing braking distance and reducing tire traction" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Reduced visibility due to heavy rain and spray, obscuring pedestrians, cyclists, and other vehicles" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential rear-end collision risk due to slippery conditions and reduced visibility" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:evidence1 a :RollingBallIndicator ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk1, :risk2 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.9"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.85"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.8"^^xsd:float .
```

